{"id": "EUVD-2026-106889", "enisaUuid": "bcb78f4e-c215-3cdc-87da-2838a1e8bddb", "description": "Trigger.dev before 4.5.5 contains a missing authentication vulnerability in the realtime streams POST handler that allows unauthenticated attackers to inject data into run streams. Attackers can send POST requests to /realtime/v1/streams/:runId/:streamId with a predictable run friendlyId to inject arbitrary data into any environment's realtime stream, including production.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T00:36:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T00:36:52", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/triggerdotdev/trigger.dev/security/advisories/GHSA-59h8-w5q6-mfmp", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/trigger-dev-before-4.5.5-unauthenticated-realtime-stream-data-injection-via-streams-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-114086", "GHSA-h43q-m2j9-rjvp"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ca4880e8-cb87-3ba5-81e9-af3b6f554cce", "product": {"name": "trigger.dev", "vendor": {"name": "triggerdotdev"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.5.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e31a5531-0e60-3c48-88c6-07a29eee1fd8", "vendor": {"name": "triggerdotdev"}}], "isExploited": false}